      ],
      "message": "autotools: run constant-time tests in make check\n\nRun ctime_tests through a shell test with its own runner so LOG_COMPILER\ndoes not wrap it a second time in CI. Prefer MSan when enabled; otherwise\nuse Valgrind with --error-exitcode=42 for native builds when available.\n\nRemove the separate CI invocation now that make check covers it, and\ndocument how to run or disable the test.",
